WEBVTT

00:55:26.292 --> 00:55:30.798
when the new jobs that are being created
in the compassionate category

00:55:30.822 --> 00:55:32.838
are not paid very well,

00:55:32.862 --> 00:55:36.735
and therefore also don't have
very high social status.

00:55:36.759 --> 00:55:39.648
So we need to work on changing that.

00:55:39.672 --> 00:55:41.125
CA: And this connects directly

00:55:41.149 --> 00:55:43.220
with one other recommendation
that you have,

00:55:43.244 --> 00:55:45.014
which I think is really interesting.

00:55:45.038 --> 00:55:46.204
Which is an alternative

00:55:46.228 --> 00:55:48.506
to the much talked-about
universal basic income.

00:55:48.530 --> 00:55:51.150
In Silicon Valley and elsewhere,
it's fashionable to say

00:55:51.174 --> 00:55:54.863
the only response, as technology takes
more and more jobs,

00:55:54.887 --> 00:55:57.704
is that we're going to just
have to pay everyone a flat wage

00:55:57.728 --> 00:56:00.752
and let them then figure out
their own meaning to their lives